{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12127","headline":"客舍赠郑贲 · 钱起","name":"客舍赠郑贲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"结交意不薄，匪席言莫违。\n世义随波久，人生知己稀。\n先鸣誓相达，未遇还相依。\n一望金门诏，三看黄鸟飞。\n暝投同旅食，朝出易儒衣。\n嵇向林庐接，携手行将归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12127.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12127","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}